<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan will never abandon democracy, President Lee.</title>
<headline>Taiwan will never abandon democracy, President Lee.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan President Lee Teng-hui on Thursday urged rival China to stop pressuring the island to change, pledging never to abandon democracy or Taipei's hope for peace.</p>
<p>&quot;Nothing good will come out of one side forcing its will on the other,&quot; Lee told a reception marking Hong Kong's handover to Chinese sovereignty.</p>
</text>
